Resources Resquests and Resources Limits
========================================
Resources Resquests
Resources Resquests specify minimum CPU and memory request for a POD to be scheduled on a worker node.
K8s uses these values to decide in which worker node to place and to guarantee the requested resources.

Resources Limits
Resources Limits specify the maximum CPU and Memory a POD is allowed to use in the cluster.
When CPU limit reaches, POD starts running slower.
When the memory limit is reached, process running inside the POD will be killed [OOM - OutOfMemory].

Resources Limits must be greater than or equal to resources requests.

CPU
1 core cpu ==>> 1000 Mill Cores
